	"description": "随手记：笔记（Markdown）、待办（优先级/截止/重复）、日程提醒（每天/每周/每月/间隔/cron，服务端定时、重启不丢，到点弹通知）三合一。顶栏按钮打开可自由拖拽的全局浮窗（位置/尺寸记忆，设置也在浮窗里），没有独立视图页；5 个 AI 工具 + /note /todo /remind 让 agent 和你自己都能往里写。",
	"descriptionEn": "Notes, todos and scheduled reminders in one place: markdown notes, todos with priority/due/repeat, and reminders (daily/weekly/monthly/interval/cron) fired server-side so they survive restarts. The 📓 topbar button opens a freely draggable floating panel (position, size and settings all live in it) — there is no separate view tab; 5 AI tools and the /note /todo /remind commands let both you and the agent write into it.",
	"apiVersion": 2,
	"view": false,
	"preload": true,
	"permissions": ["ui", "http", "tools", "fs", "dom:anchor"],
	"settings": [
		{
			"key": "mirrorEnabled",
			"type": "boolean",
			"label": "镜像成 Markdown 文件（Mirror to Markdown）",
			"default": false,
			"hint": "每次改动把每篇笔记写成一个 .md，另生成 _todos.md / _reminders.md 两个汇总，放到下面那个目录里 —— 给 Obsidian / git 用。注意是**单向导出**：真相仍在插件自己的 json 库里，改镜像文件不会回流。"
		},
		{
			"key": "mirrorDir",
			"type": "text",
			"label": "镜像目录（绝对路径）",
			"default": "",
			"hint": "例如 D:/notes-vault/pi-notes。工作区外的目录首次写入时浏览器会弹一次授权确认；清理只删我们自己在 .pi-notes-mirror.json 索引里记过的文件。"
		}
	],
